        },
        {
          "text": "Hano Abhamisiri bhonsui bhagootëröë na inchara, bhakaya harë Bharao kömököörra iga abhahe ibhiakörea. Nawe akabhateebhia iga, “Mötaya harë Yusubhu; mökore kërë gionsui arabhateebhi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.55",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.55"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
